    "displayName": "SHADE-Arena",
    "aliases": ["SHADE Arena", "Subtle Harmful Agent Detection & Evaluation Arena", "SHADE-Arena (hidden CoT)"],
    "description": "Tests whether an agent can finish a benign main task and a hidden harmful side task without a monitor noticing. Environments give tools and long synthetic state. Programmatic checks score main and side task success. A monitor model rates suspicion from 0 to 100. Sabotage success needs both tasks done with suspicion under 80.",
    "summary": "Tests whether AI agents can secretly complete a harmful side task while doing a normal task without detection.",
